What is the output of the following Java program resolving multiple default method inheritance?
```java
interface EngineLeft {
    default void ignite() { System.out.print("L"); }
}
interface EngineRight {
    default void ignite() { System.out.print("R"); }
}
class RocketShip implements EngineLeft, EngineRight {
    public void ignite() {
        EngineLeft.super.ignite();
        EngineRight.super.ignite();
    }
}
public class RocketApp {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        new RocketShip().ignite();
    }
}
```

